#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:1
#: fc5326f16c4d455b9249c454fa2db2c3
msgid "代表性采样（最远点采样）"
msgstr "Representative sampling (Farthest Point Sampling)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:3
#: 542cb4f3a9214439811c394fe7a1e94e
msgid "界面按钮：`代表性采样`（`Sparse samples`）。"
msgstr "Interface button: `Representative Sampling` (`Sparse samples`)."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:5
#: f9a52e99ea59432d96cf3cc586631086
msgid "这个工具解决什么问题"
msgstr "What problem does this tool solve?"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:7
#: bf316ab2146747e6911dd28db13e3b5c
msgid ""
"候选池里经常有大量相似结构。最远点采样（Farthest Point Sampling，FPS）把每个结构表示成一个 "
"描述符向量，并优先选择离已有样本最远的结构，从而用较少样本覆盖较大的描述符空间。"
msgstr ""
"Candidate pools often contain many similar structures. Farthest Point "
"Sampling (FPS) represents each structure as a descriptor vector and "
"repeatedly chooses the structure farthest from the samples already "
"selected, covering a larger descriptor space with fewer structures."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:10
#: a02512a34982474aa223c8d6d8d0b250
msgid "它解决的是**冗余**，不是**数据质量**。短键、错误标签和不合理结构应先清洗，再做 FPS。"
msgstr ""
"It addresses **redundancy**, not **data quality**. Clean short bonds, "
"incorrect labels, and unreasonable structures before running FPS."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:12
#: d3c2f75ea140462cbf84a9dabcb908da
msgid "最远点采样原理"
msgstr "How Farthest Point Sampling works"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:14
#: 014edea97f244aa78c692b4790b868e2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"设第 $i$ 个候选结构的描述符为 $\\mathbf{x}_i$，当前已经选出的描述符集合为 $S$。 每一轮计算候选点到集合 $S$ "
"的最近距离："
msgstr ""
"Let $\\mathbf{x}_i$ be the descriptor of candidate structure $i$, and let"
" $S$ be the set of descriptors selected so far. At each step, compute the"
" nearest distance from each candidate to $S$:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:17
#: cbab8d7d55d44d4e9be670aa4412a9c0
msgid ""
"\n"
"d(i,S)=\\min_{\\mathbf{x}_j\\in "
"S}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\mathbf{x}_j\\right\\|_2\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"d(i,S)=\\min_{\\mathbf{x}_j\\in "
"S}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\mathbf{x}_j\\right\\|_2\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:21
#: b4a15ea5d22b4b548e719f6a639e978e
msgid "然后选择最近距离最大的候选："
msgstr "Then choose the candidate with the largest nearest distance:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:23
#: 89d6478d96b84ec18ef00cd13ec63a41
msgid ""
"\n"
"i^\\*=\\arg\\max_{i\\notin S}d(i,S),\\qquad\n"
"S\\leftarrow S\\cup\\{\\mathbf{x}_{i^\\*}\\}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"i^\\*=\\arg\\max_{i\\notin S}d(i,S),\\qquad\n"
"S\\leftarrow S\\cup\\{\\mathbf{x}_{i^\\*}\\}\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:28
#: 9ca4dcc8aea846ccbd397dc66b7a94fb
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$\\mathbf{x}_i$ 是结构级 NEP 描述符或其 PCA 坐标，没有 Å、eV 之类的物理单位。"
msgstr ""
"$\\mathbf{x}_i$ is a structure-level NEP descriptor or its PCA "
"coordinates; it does not have physical units such as Å or eV."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:29
#: dd38f38f9ced45a9a2ed7da4e39018fe
msgid "$\\|\\cdot\\|_2$ 是欧氏距离。"
msgstr "$\\|\\cdot\\|_2$ is the Euclidean distance."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:30
#: 025766ef17d34eaf811b91c220b110cc
msgid ""
"`最小距离`（`Min distance`）记为 $\\delta$。当所有剩余候选都满足 $d(i,S)<\\delta$ "
"时，采样会提前停止，所以实际数量可以小于“样本上限”。"
msgstr ""
"Let `Min distance` be $\\delta$. Sampling stops early when every "
"remaining candidate satisfies $d(i,S)<\\delta$, so the actual count can "
"be smaller than the sample limit."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:32
#: 9362262b782c4aa08e45c84023b03e44
msgid "提供“训练数据集”后，训练集描述符会作为初始集合 $S_0$。此时优先选择训练集尚未覆盖的候选， 而不是重新挑一批与训练集重复的结构。"
msgstr ""
"When a training dataset is provided, its descriptors form the initial set"
" $S_0$. The sampler then prioritizes candidates not covered by the "
"training set instead of selecting another batch that duplicates it."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:36
#: ed73f6f6f40d44988014039e35667201
msgid ""
"`最小距离`的数值依赖当前 NEP 模型以及“原始描述符/降维后描述符”的选择，不能跨模型直接复用。 更换 `nep.txt` "
"或描述符来源后，应重新观察距离尺度。"
msgstr ""
"The value of `Min distance` depends on the current NEP model and on "
"whether raw or reduced descriptors are used; it cannot be reused blindly "
"across models. Recheck the distance scale after changing `nep.txt` or the"
" descriptor source."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:40
#: b674541b0bc84004b2461ce4b1d56ad1
msgid "三种选择策略"
msgstr "Three selection strategies"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 608a586a208142c8b1c272a2e37f67f8 dd59b98983b94982ba9131f22585cdee
msgid "中文界面选项"
msgstr "Chinese UI option"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: fcf0aa964cf7422fb3cea21aad36884f
msgid "算法"
msgstr "Algorithm"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: ca1afb1b0b1147ba93ad3ae49df6590c
msgid "适用场景"
msgstr "Use Case"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: d165301231984f73b9ec56b90f4167bf
msgid "主要限制"
msgstr "Main limitation"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 1f0e314289884316ad2fefe36af8aba1
msgid "`全局 FPS（兼容模式）`"
msgstr "`Global FPS (compatibility mode)`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 7f68e68d0b714a019d9cdbe6fc0dee34
msgid "所有候选共享一个 FPS 集合和总预算"
msgstr "All candidates share one FPS set and one total budget"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 0cee7627433a41a8b285ea47259e02a6
msgid "数据属于同一化学体系，或希望完全复现旧流程"
msgstr ""
"The data belong to one chemical system, or you need to reproduce the "
"legacy workflow exactly"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: a15f6d93e4b84226b036c541768064bd
msgid "大数据组可能占满预算，小元素集合可能一个都选不到"
msgstr ""
"A large group can consume the budget, leaving a small element set with no"
" samples"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 44da128a73d64e70abe7d58e6fcff661
msgid "`元素集合平衡 FPS`"
msgstr "`Element-set-balanced FPS`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: ef946b1381854caa898f4e7687128d8c
msgid "先按结构所含元素集合分组，再在每组内独立 FPS"
msgstr ""
"Group structures by their element set, then run FPS independently within "
"each group"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 6ee3fea77276409ebc88bee9e99f7b4b
msgid "一个候选池混有 Fe、Fe-O、Fe-Ni-O 等不同体系"
msgstr "One candidate pool mixes systems such as Fe, Fe-O, and Fe-Ni-O"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 4542434248f745e1a6be255e18952827
msgid "强制使用原始描述符和固定数量模式；样本上限不得小于元素集合组数"
msgstr ""
"Requires raw descriptors and fixed-count mode; the sample limit must be "
"at least the number of element-set groups"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: c5507aabd1594103ae971325a441afc8
msgid "`元素集合 / 晶相 / 磁序 FPS`"
msgstr "`Element-set / phase / magnetic-order FPS`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 498de2fb89d947538618cdcea1d40410
msgid "按元素集合、晶相和磁序建立物理分层，再根据局域环境描述符在层内 FPS"
msgstr ""
"Build physical strata by element set, phase, and magnetic order, "
"then run FPS independently within each stratum"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: 112fb8d16f9540098a42f7498c6de07d
msgid "FeNi 等体系同时存在浓度偏斜、BCC/FCC 和多种 spin 排列"
msgstr ""
"A single element set such as FeNi contains concentration imbalance, "
"BCC/FCC phases, and multiple spin arrangements"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:35
#: c2303618b8274c0ea5e1cc9c7e7fec96
msgid "强制使用原始描述符；可选择用户总上限或自动描述符覆盖数量"
msgstr "Requires raw descriptors; choose either a user-defined global cap or an automatically determined descriptor-coverage count"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:48
#: 770df72b1c294b90b9eb42a2af6044ff
msgid "平衡策略先给每个非空元素集合一个名额。剩余预算按组大小的平方根分配。若第 $g$ 组有 $n_g$ 个候选，其额外名额近似满足："
msgstr ""
"The balanced strategy first gives one slot to each non-empty element set."
" It distributes the remaining budget by the square root of the group "
"size. If group $g$ has $n_g$ candidates, its additional allocation "
"approximately satisfies:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:51
#: ffaa0ec17fb247e8b4a85abb87115f6e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"q_g-1\\propto\\sqrt{n_g}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"q_g-1\\propto\\sqrt{n_g}\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:55
#: 9831783d789e4e6e94d2422e58adbf45
msgid ""
"程序还会把名额限制在该组实际结构数以内，并按小数余量补齐整数预算。没有训练集时，每组从最靠近 "
"该组描述符中心的结构开始；有训练集时，只使用**元素集合完全相同**的训练结构作为该组初始集合。"
msgstr ""
"The program also caps each allocation at the number of structures in that"
" group and rounds the integer budget using the fractional remainders. "
"Without a training set, each group starts from the structure closest to "
"its descriptor center; with a training set, only training structures with"
" exactly the same element set seed that group."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:58
#: b247e88b298844bcb6b8125c85eeb7b7
msgid "平方根配额比按结构数线性分配更照顾小组，但它不表示各体系同等重要。训练目标本身有明确权重时， 仍应先拆分候选池或分别设定预算。"
msgstr ""
"A square-root allocation gives small groups more consideration than a "
"linear allocation by group size, but it does not mean that all systems "
"are equally important. If the training objective has explicit weights, "
"split the candidate pool or set separate budgets first."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:61
#: 3c9acfcfeabf4af6aef1fd756ca4c679
msgid ""
"物理平衡策略复用 `Training Set Audit` 的保守晶相和磁序识别。它先给每个已观察到的 "
"“元素集合—晶相—磁序”分层一个名额，再按各层的描述符覆盖缺口和下一采样点的边际收益分配剩余预算。 `mixed` 和 `unresolved` "
"会作为独立分层保留，不会被强行猜成 BCC 或 FCC。"
msgstr ""
"The physics-balanced strategy reuses the conservative phase and magnetic-"
"order classifiers from `Training Set Audit`. It first reserves one slot "
"for every observed element-set--phase--magnetic-order stratum, then "
"allocates the remaining budget according to each stratum's descriptor-"
"coverage gap and the marginal gain of the next sample. `mixed` and "
"`unresolved` remain separate strata instead of being "
"forced into BCC or FCC."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:65
#: f58158023afc4ea995e5663dc255c39a
msgid "层内 FPS 并不只看一个结构平均描述符。物理平衡策略把以下连续证据分别归一化并按特征块平衡后， 拼成同一个代表性采样空间："
msgstr ""
"Within-stratum FPS does not rely on a single structure-averaged "
"descriptor. The physics-balanced strategy normalizes and block-balances "
"the following continuous evidence into one representative sampling space:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:68
#: 29e102e8857c41b5b5ab6484bcad0fc5
msgid "NEP 原子描述符的结构均值、标准差和最大局域偏离，用于同时保留整体环境、环境分布和少数极端局域环境；"
msgstr ""
"The structure mean, standard deviation, and maximum local deviation of "
"atomic NEP descriptors preserve the overall environment, its "
"distribution, and rare extreme local environments."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:69
#: 954ed635cd5f4ce0ac10aff1ee7604fa
msgid "每原子体积、晶胞形状、夹角和周期性，用于显式保留体积、应变和晶格形状变化；"
msgstr ""
"Volume per atom, cell shape, cell angles, and periodicity explicitly "
"preserve volume, strain, and lattice-shape variation."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:70
#: e9e6b7cf50304681b171a314ef9dca30
msgid "spin 模型的磁矩大小与离散度、净磁矩比例、共线度、共面度、近邻关联以及经过晶胞换算和正负号等价处理的 `q_peak/q-vector` 证据。"
msgstr ""
"For spin models, the features also include moment magnitude and spread, "
"net-moment ratio, collinearity, coplanarity, nearest-neighbor "
"correlation, and cell-aware, sign-equivalent `q_peak/q-vector` evidence."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:72
#: 1208d88306f542c7a4d7407a21895823
msgid ""
"这些连续证据只用于同一硬分层内部的距离；元素集合、晶相和磁序仍是不能被 FPS 距离冲掉的硬分层。全局浓度不单独建立硬层，它通过不同局域化学环境在"
" NEP 描述符分布中体现。 若旧结果只有结构平均描述符、又没有可调用的 NEP calculator，软件会保留功能并退回“描述符均值 + 晶格"
" + 磁性证据”， 但不会伪称已经比较了原子描述符的分布和尾部。"
msgstr ""
"These continuous features define distances only within the same hard "
"stratum; element set, phase, and magnetic order remain hard strata that "
"FPS distances cannot erase. Global concentration does not form a separate "
"hard stratum; it is represented through different local chemical "
"environments in the NEP descriptor distribution. If an older result contains only "
"structure-averaged descriptors and no callable NEP calculator, sampling "
"remains available with descriptor mean, lattice, and magnetic evidence, "
"but the application does not claim to have compared atomic-descriptor "
"distributions or tails."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:76
#: 8ce760284a9e4ea581fcf60303bf5577
msgid ""
"检测到 spin 模型后，候选集和已有训练集都必须提供规范的逐原子 `spin:R:3`。 `mforce` 与 `force_mag` "
"是监督标签，不能代替 spin 输入。普通 NEP 模型仍按元素集合和晶相分层，磁序轴不启用。"
msgstr ""
"For a detected spin model, both candidates and the existing training set "
"must provide canonical per-atom `spin:R:3`. `mforce` and `force_mag` are "
"supervision labels and cannot replace spin input. For an ordinary NEP "
"model, stratification uses element set and phase only; the magnetic-order"
" axis is disabled."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:79
#: 179378ed62614776bd60d96da825bbc6
msgid ""
"启用“缓存输出文件”后，第一次物理平衡采样会在描述符输出目录保存压缩的 `*.phase-sampling.jsonl.gz` "
"分层缓存；再次加载同一数据、同一活动范围和同一识别版本时直接复用。 "
"旧版本已经生成的晶相与磁序证据缓存也会自动转换成这一轻量分层缓存；旧的精确浓度分层缓存会在读取时折叠为元素集合分层并写回新格式，不要求重新分析。 "
"数据内容、活动范围或识别方法版本变化时，缓存指纹不匹配，程序会安全地重新计算。"
msgstr ""
"When **Cache output files** is enabled, the first physics-balanced "
"sampling run saves a compressed `*.phase-sampling.jsonl.gz` "
"stratification cache in the descriptor output directory. The cache is "
"reused when the same data, active scope, and classifier version are "
"loaded again. Phase and magnetic evidence caches written by earlier "
"versions are automatically migrated into this compact stratification "
"cache. Legacy exact-concentration strata are folded into element-set strata "
"and written back in the new format without repeating the analysis. If the data content, active scope, "
"or classifier version changes, the fingerprint no longer matches and the "
"application recomputes the partitions safely."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:84
#: 174ec00c06e74eefa020c8e26c8aeef1
msgid "两种采样模式"
msgstr "Two sampling modes"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:86
#: cb532c880cab4c72a4dd7d961cf8a60d
msgid "固定数量（FPS）"
msgstr "Fixed count (FPS)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:88
#: 8a7a410a9d76474f8fc794e07b3a4abd
msgid "“用户定义总上限”模式最多选择“样本上限”个结构，并在全部物理层之间分配这一个总预算。以下任一条件满足时提前结束："
msgstr ""
"User-defined global-cap mode selects at most “Sample limit” structures and "
"allocates that single total budget across all physical strata. Stop early when any of the "
"following is true:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:90
#: 3e051d8f0b5d46eb92548f4bd0abdc5e
msgid "已达到样本上限；"
msgstr "The sample limit has been reached;"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:91
#: 2f58c209dffc4fd78962cb2fbd077701
msgid "候选已用完；"
msgstr "No candidates remain;"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:92
#: fac223904fbf4806834645d690407f17
msgid "最大最近距离小于“最小距离”。"
msgstr "The largest nearest distance is below “Min distance”."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:94
#: 8e34c32fee4d4a17bfe74f5cebce1dfa
msgid "因此“样本上限”是全局上限，不是每层数量，也不是保证数量。"
msgstr "Therefore, “Sample limit” is a global cap, not a per-stratum count or a guaranteed count."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:96
#: 55e53d30638f46e8a4f73f65c3363261
msgid "“自动描述符覆盖”模式不读取样本上限和最小距离。程序在每个元素集合—晶相—磁序层内按描述符覆盖目标独立确定数量，再把各层数量汇总并直接使用同一次分析得到的结构集合，不会先推荐数量后换一套分配算法重采样。"
msgstr "Automatic descriptor-coverage mode ignores the sample limit and minimum distance. It determines a count independently in each element-set--phase--magnetic-order stratum from the descriptor-coverage target, sums the stratum counts, and directly uses the structures selected by that same analysis; it does not recommend a count and then resample with a different allocation algorithm."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:98
#: dfe40b05e9654e31969292e0351ad851
msgid "覆盖 $R^2$ 停止（FPS）"
msgstr "Coverage-$R^2$ stopping (FPS)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:100
#: 48734852eaea4c0ea64fac2325eb9e37
msgid "只在“全局 FPS”中可选。程序每轮仍按 FPS 选点，并把所有候选到最近已选中心的平方距离作为剩余未覆盖量："
msgstr ""
"This option is available only for “Global FPS”. The program still selects"
" points by FPS and treats each candidate's squared distance to its "
"nearest selected center as the remaining uncovered amount:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:102
#: 8614b3f0cc514dd986838c128071dabd
msgid ""
"\n"
"R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}\n"
"=\n"
"1-\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\min_{\\mathbf{s}\\in S}\n"
"\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\mathbf{s}\\right\\|_2^2}\n"
"{\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}\\right\\|_2^2},"
"\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\mathbf{x}_i\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}\n"
"=\n"
"1-\n"
"\\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\min_{\\mathbf{s}\\in S}\n"
"\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\mathbf{s}\\right\\|_2^2}\n"
"{\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\left\\|\\mathbf{x}_i-\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}\\right\\|_2^2},"
"\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\bar{\\mathbf{x}}=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}\\mathbf{x}_i\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:113
#: 42b1924fd63b4764ab4e285b2f97e348
msgid ""
"结果限制在 `[0, 1]`。提供已有训练集时，它也属于初始中心集合 $S_0$，所以已有覆盖会直接提高初始分数。 当 "
"$R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ 达到“覆盖 $R^2$ 阈值”时停止；“样本上限”和“最小距离”仍然同时生效。"
msgstr ""
"The result is clipped to `[0, 1]`. When an existing training set is "
"provided, it belongs to the initial center set $S_0$, so its existing "
"coverage directly raises the initial score. Sampling stops when "
"$R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ reaches the “Coverage $R^2$ threshold”; “Sample "
"limit” and “Min distance” remain active at the same time."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:117
#: 61c7759966f24e4ab185c5ab25496e8d
msgid ""
"这里的 $R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ 是**最近中心残差定义的描述符覆盖指标**，不是回归模型的决定系数。 "
"它只能说明当前描述符空间被代表点覆盖到什么程度，不能单独证明能量、力、磁力或 TC 已经收敛。"
msgstr ""
"Here $R^2_{\\mathrm{cover}}$ is a **descriptor-coverage metric defined by"
" nearest-center residuals**, not the coefficient of determination of a "
"regression model. It only measures how well representative points cover "
"the current descriptor space; by itself it does not prove convergence of "
"energy, force, magnetic force, or TC."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:121
#: 4ec75003fcb4436f840ad83edb81ac18
msgid "描述符来源"
msgstr "Descriptor source"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 990bf15a955241f0ba17304a1d736802
msgid "实际距离空间"
msgstr "Actual distance space"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 6ea814b70caa4b939ea1917f717826ba
msgid "效果"
msgstr "Effect"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: aa50c0751bbe47b7961cab6c70ee1786
msgid "`降维后（PCA）`"
msgstr "`Reduced (PCA)`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 941a714397754c15ba1185858a3a58b6
msgid "当前数据的 PCA 坐标；合并训练集时会在候选与训练描述符上联合降到二维"
msgstr ""
"PCA coordinates of the current data; when a training set is included, "
"candidates and training descriptors are reduced jointly to two dimensions"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 7739b2d930be42e597e025688d2ca79f
msgid "速度快、便于和叠加图对应，但降维可能丢失低方差方向"
msgstr ""
"Fast and easy to compare with the overlay plot, but dimensionality "
"reduction can lose low-variance directions"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 8bfdbd55b0434ee782a63294216eb140
msgid "`原始描述符`"
msgstr "`Raw descriptors`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 81b06989d6044407bd4ccc9497ecf5dd
msgid "缓存的结构级原始描述符"
msgstr "Cached structure-level raw descriptors"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 6dd465fb75e647a89c4d72a4050e03ec
msgid "保留完整描述符信息，但距离尺度随维度和模型变化"
msgstr ""
"Preserves the full descriptor information, but the distance scale changes"
" with dimensionality and the model"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:128
#: 48f8fdca8ebd4bd6b50f19bbbc245861
msgid "如果请求原始描述符但当前没有缓存，程序会提示并回退到降维空间。元素集合平衡和物理平衡 FPS 都不允许这种回退；缺少原始描述符时会停止并报错。"
msgstr ""
"If raw descriptors are requested but no cache is available, the program "
"reports this and falls back to the reduced space. Element-set-balanced "
"and physics-balanced FPS do not allow this fallback; they stop with an "
"error when raw descriptors are missing."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:131
#: c4295d97cba542db8d243386bf705127
msgid "“将当前选择作为区域”到底做什么"
msgstr "What does “Use current selection as region” actually do?"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:133
#: f7f45def5e75427999d6830172e71e26
msgid "这个选项不是“把当前选择当作已经保留的训练集”，而是把当前选中的结构限制为**本次 FPS 的候选区域**："
msgstr ""
"This option does not treat the current selection as an already-retained "
"training set. Instead, it restricts the current selection to the "
"**candidate region for this FPS run**:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:135
#: 7d9a136443354e6eb61a7b6686670caf
msgid "先在主图上选中想清理的局部点群。"
msgstr ""
"First select the local cluster of points you want to clean on the main "
"plot."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:136
#: ecb0e402267b4667a51e248e92ea6e63
msgid "勾选“将当前选择作为区域”并运行 FPS。"
msgstr "Check “Use current selection as region” and run FPS."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:137
#: 7c9a67005fc14915b0f35264b7e42ec4
msgid "FPS 只在这批已选结构中找代表点。"
msgstr ""
"FPS searches for representative points only within the selected "
"structures."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:138
#: e97ef36a05a0452f9bafcbf46c0361df
msgid "运行结束后，程序会把代表点从当前选择中**取消选择**。"
msgstr ""
"When the run ends, the program **deselects** the representative points "
"from the current selection."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:139
#: 03132050a77e4db7a6a88dbd3784a261
msgid "仍保持选中的，是该区域内未被 FPS 保留的冗余结构，可直接点击“删除选中结构”。"
msgstr ""
"The structures that remain selected are redundant structures in that "
"region that FPS did not retain; you can click “Delete selected "
"structures” directly."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:141
#: c105ea482ce64ea9bc5414511f55500a
msgid ""
"也就是说，它实现的是“在选定区域内保留代表点、留下冗余点供删除”。如果当前没有选择，或者当前子图 "
"上找不到这些选择，程序会提示并退回到全数据采样；此时结果会按普通方式加入选择集。"
msgstr ""
"In other words, it keeps representative points within the selected region"
" and leaves redundant points selected for deletion. If nothing is "
"selected, or the current subplot cannot find those selections, the "
"program reports the issue and falls back to sampling all data; the result"
" is then added to the selection set normally."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:144
#: 08651fc2294644e791ea13c14bac9bfe
msgid "其他参数"
msgstr "Other parameters"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 586e415dc1514100b2711a0f409a9c9d
msgid "中文界面字段"
msgstr "UI field"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 6a7058464ad747499a5ebe074c00f151
msgid "怎么选"
msgstr "How to choose"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 3ff316c878cb4020919bb278bac0a9e4
msgid "改变什么"
msgstr "What it changes"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 8307db5f557846f0a4437af71599e4b9
msgid "`物理采样数量`"
msgstr "`Physical sampling count`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: ce4acd406712437a8f114d1fcec58f87
msgid "物理分层策略可选“用户定义总上限”或“自动描述符覆盖”"
msgstr "For physics stratification, choose either `User-defined global cap` or `Automatic descriptor coverage`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 4775980764f740a198e14f46a9908ecb
msgid "前者分配一个全局上限；后者由各物理层覆盖需求汇总数量"
msgstr "The former allocates one global cap; the latter sums the counts required for coverage in each physical stratum"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 0f298bb1076848b8b8886a893d845c58
msgid "`样本上限`"
msgstr "`Sample limit`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 068d977645ce42b9942fdb2e0d5bf5a1
msgid "固定数量模式填目标上限；覆盖 $R^2$ 模式填安全上限"
msgstr ""
"Enter the desired cap in fixed-count mode, or a safety cap in "
"coverage-$R^2$ mode"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: d9f674750e2a4a598d1e35f57dba03dc
msgid "限制最多选择多少结构；自动物理覆盖模式下不使用此项"
msgstr "Caps the number of selected structures; unused in automatic physics-coverage mode"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 40e7618247494a63b6ea5e48578f6d50
msgid "`最小距离`"
msgstr "`Minimum distance`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: b5893fadf55b4b00a5c1d60b19d306e9
msgid "从较小值开始，根据实际选择数量和覆盖图调整"
msgstr ""
"Start with a small value, then adjust it using the actual selection count"
" and coverage plot"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: c5c7d352214342b68aaa05d9e3622640
msgid "调大通常减少结果并提高样本间隔；调小允许保留更相似的结构"
msgstr ""
"A larger value usually selects fewer, more widely separated samples; a "
"smaller value permits more similar structures"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 2e93ad261b5f488fb11478d35dfd64f6
msgid "`覆盖 R^2 阈值`"
msgstr "`Coverage R^2 threshold`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 00aee2536a344d3db8c5b374d1d4d757
msgid "只在覆盖 $R^2$ 模式生效，范围 `[0, 1]`"
msgstr "Used only in coverage-$R^2$ mode; valid range: `[0, 1]`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 23bb2051711444c88293b9694be961c1
msgid "调高通常选择更多结构；仍可能先被样本上限或最小距离截断"
msgstr ""
"A higher value usually selects more structures, although the sample limit"
" or minimum distance may stop sampling first"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: c95b2a71d9414eb09a45b6fcef74bdfb
msgid "`训练数据集`"
msgstr "`Training dataset`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: dcd61c3b49004c708aa2284f0f491fe3
msgid "选择已有训练集的 `.xyz` 或目录"
msgstr "Select an existing training-set `.xyz` file or directory"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 5fa3917b31814554a258e72b2a95cc44
msgid "用已有训练描述符预热距离；全局模式读取失败时忽略预热，平衡模式读取或维度不匹配会报错"
msgstr ""
"Seeds distances with existing training descriptors; global mode ignores "
"the seed if loading fails, while balanced mode reports loading or "
"dimension-mismatch errors"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 1c6bb671599341379337bc604986915d
msgid "`显示训练集叠加图`"
msgstr "`Show training-set overlay`"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: b418e46567c34d0fbf32cb635bc424e8
msgid "只有填写训练数据集路径时才有结果"
msgstr "Produces a result only when a training-dataset path is provided"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:116
#: 220e603f21a24b378e7b4fa7528a6365
msgid "采样后把训练集、当前数据和入选结构联合投影到 PCA 图中；只用于观察，不改变采样结果"
msgstr ""
"After sampling, jointly projects the training set, current data, and "
"selected structures onto a PCA plot; this visualization does not change "
"the sampling result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:155
#: 8b5674acc8bf448ea876ddb0a61ddb27
msgid "![最远点采样设置](../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_sparse_dialog.png)"
msgstr ""
"![Farthest Point Sampling "
"settings](../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_sparse_dialog.png)"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:155
#: bec7589f493a4ddaa387c88008440617
msgid "最远点采样设置"
msgstr "Farthest Point Sampling settings"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:155
#: bec7589f493a4ddaa387c88008440617
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_sparse_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_sparse_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:157
#: 6df8db5e5ae04db5b3abb7ba687b3188
msgid "跑完检查什么"
msgstr "What to check after sampling"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:159
#: 38146e5fbd0449648d383c7637ab5052
msgid "看实际选择数量是否因“最小距离”或覆盖 $R^2$ 阈值提前停止，并核对界面报告的最终覆盖分数。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the actual selection count stopped early because of the "
"minimum distance or coverage-$R^2$ threshold, and verify the final "
"coverage score reported by the UI."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:160
#: 6fe3f68b38f14005836c9db71e5a1f32
msgid "看元素集合平衡模式是否覆盖了预期的每个元素集合。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether element-set-balanced mode covered every expected element "
"set."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:161
#: b4eabc45e70444d88787f3cb0b958b0f
msgid ""
"对 spin 模型，核对物理平衡模式是否覆盖了预期的元素集合、BCC/FCC 和磁序分层；不同浓度由层内局域环境覆盖体现。BCC 的 TC "
"通过不能替代 FCC 独立验证。"
msgstr ""
"For a spin model, verify that physics-balanced mode covers the expected "
"element sets, BCC/FCC phases, and magnetic-order strata; different "
"concentrations are represented by local-environment coverage within each "
"stratum. Passing "
"BCC TC does not replace independent FCC validation."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:162
#: 6dde39da15d64939955cfd4e7451b341
msgid "有训练集时，看叠加图中新样本是否落在训练集空白区域，而不是大量堆在已有训练点附近。"
msgstr ""
"When a training set is provided, use the overlay plot to verify that new "
"samples fill uncovered regions instead of clustering around existing "
"training points."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:163
#: 002abe8abd73409ea42115fbcf416caa
msgid "回到结构视图抽查代表点；描述符距离大可能来自真实新环境，也可能来自坏结构。"
msgstr ""
"Return to the structure view and inspect representative samples; a large "
"descriptor distance may indicate a genuinely new environment or a "
"malformed structure."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-sparse-samples.md:164
#: 3831fd1a3fac45d0b9c878fe608c4d0b
msgid "使用“当前选择作为区域”时，删除前确认：**仍被选中的才是准备删除的冗余点**。"
msgstr ""
"When using “Use current selection as region”, confirm before deletion "
"that **the points still selected are the redundant structures to "
"remove**."

